{"id": 107, "name": "Natan", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4431d3412e6cff8fccc5cdf67454a08b.png", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Burst", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["20", "60", "20", "20"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "The savior who travels through time and space.", "skills": [{"name": "Theory of Everything", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_46d9e05fa708f5acf2026d596a406f0f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Natan gains a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Entanglement</span> each time he or his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Reverse-Clone</span> hits an enemy with a skill (up to 6 stacks). Each stack lasts 2.5s and grants 7.5% Attack Speed and 5% Movement Speed.\nNatan's Basic Attack projectiles will return to Natan after reaching the maximum range, dealing an extra 30<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies along the way (inherits a portion of Attack Effects). Hitting an enemy refreshes <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Entanglement</span>'s duration."}, {"name": "Superposition", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0f70bd309c626de414c448bfb83bddd6.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Natan shoots a dense mass of energy in the target direction, dealing 225<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+120% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in its path."}, {"name": "Interference!", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6cc955ea774b6680a2868fdd186042cf.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "ta